-- 3. Add PostGIS geography(Point,4326) columns and GiST indexes when radius/nearest-site queries are frequent.
-- 4. Put evidence bytes in object storage; evidence_files stores immutable metadata and hashes only.
-- 5. Use read replicas/materialized aggregates for dashboards; do not overload OLTP indexes for analytics.
